igure 1</label><caption><p>Product-limit survival curves for probability of lung cancer mortality for those who changed to a portable stove compared with those with no change.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="eps" xlink:href="6604744f1"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Lifetime smoky coal users by stove use history in Xuanwei, China, 1976&#x02013;1996</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>No stove change (<italic>N</italic>=4364)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Change to portable stove (<italic>N</italic>=4054)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Total subjects (<italic>N</italic>=8418)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Men and women</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Person-years</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">60&#x02009;322.77</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">78&#x02009;195.92</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">138&#x02009;518.69</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Age as of 1 January 1976</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">42.4 (&#x000b1;11.0)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">37.2 (&#x000b1;10.4)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">39.9 (&#x000b1;11.0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Age at exit from follow-up</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">56.2 (&#x000b1;9.9)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">56.2 (&#x000b1;9.4)</td><td align